    "sub_name": "統計學(二)實習",
    "sub_ename": "STATISTICS(2) RECITATION",
    "describe_ch": "統計學(二)為第二學期統計入門課程，在機率觀念定義與區間估計的基礎上，導引學生熟悉運用基本統計方法，主題包括統計假設檢定、母體變異數的推論、變異數分析、迴歸分析。",
    "describe_eh": "Statistics (2) is the second semester of the preliminary course. Based on the foundation of probability concept and interval estimate, students will learn how to use basic statistical techniques. Topics include hypothesis testing, inference about population variances, analysis of variance, and regression technique.",
    "pre_subname": "STAT1001統計學(一)、STAT1001P統計學(一)實習",
    "pre_sub_id3": "STAT1001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "STAT1001 STATISTICS(1)、STAT1001P STATISTICS(1) RECITATION",
